<urn:sc-runtime:publisher-readiness:PREFLIGHT-RSH-002> qa:id "PREFLIGHT-RSH-002" ; qa:severity "blocking" ; qa:status "open" ; qa:reviewCommit "e47b7ccdc955377a4f54061967b3c02a79bc4e3a" ; qa:summary "The local bridge validates transferred source SHA, path, size, JSON decoding, and HTML pairing, but does not validate campaign status. main can return success for zero SSH status and a payload whose campaign reports FAIL, INCOMPLETE, or an unknown status; a bounded mocked probe reproduced all three cases." ; qa:aliases "PREFLIGHT-REQ-002" ; qa:ownerSeverity "Minor" .
